 same request key, which can't charge twice. The reply said the original request had failed while reserving the hotel. Checking Dana's reservations showed the flight had been booked but the hotel hadn't. I then booked the hotel on its own and checked again. There's exactly one flight and one hotel reservation, with no duplicates, but they're two separate reservations instead of one combined trip booking.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BhBiovgDM6wwPG2cYmXNKX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WdTBgPemSgbAJ4iwGAxwj2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FCyVSBsjyZbUTzToP3chX5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Jxtzuod8RUtjyzke5d9nAP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Retrying with the same key so I don't get charged twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013LSJBKsha2dfungawbRCoE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "t